      "effect": "Each player sends 2 cards from the top of their Deck to the Graveyard, and inflict damage to your opponent equal to [the number of monsters sent to the Graveyard by this effect] x 100. Then, if a face-up Equip Spell Card is on your field, you can change 1 Attack Position monster on your opponent's field to face-up Defense Position."
